VG OutDev website - https://vgoutdev.com
Built with Jekyll and published automatically by GitHub Pages on every push to main.

PREVIEW BEFORE PUSHING
  Double-click preview.cmd (or run .\preview.ps1 in PowerShell).
  It opens http://localhost:4000 and reloads the page whenever you save a file.
  Press Ctrl+C in the window to stop. Nothing is uploaded until you git push.

WHERE THINGS ARE
  _data/products.yml   product list (home page + /products/)
  about.markdown       About page
  *_terms.markdown     app privacy policies - linked from the app stores, do not rename
  _layouts, _includes  page templates
  assets/css/site.scss all styles
